Z||000000||Oreif||01-31-2001||03:00 PM||||Hey ALL, I am going to be writing an article for our club newsletter on Stereo installations in a Fiero. I plan on making in VERY detailed. I know many have installed large systems. What I would like is permission to use some of your pics that you have posted on PFF. I can do a search to locate them and I will credit those with unique installs. (Fierosound's subs as an example) This will most likely be posted on our clubs website at a future date. I just want to make sure that I don't "step on someone's toe's". If you do not want me to use your idea's or pics please let me know.<BR>If you have not posted any pic but want to be included, post them here or Email them to me.<BR>Thanks in advance for any help.<P><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg"> ||||reg||4
