Z||000012||Oreif||02-11-2001||10:43 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierosound:<BR><B>You may want to include this website...<P>4 subs, 2 behind seats, 2 in rear glass area<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero_stereo/start.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero_stereo/start.html</A> </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The guy who did that is an IDIOT. First I had shut down IE with task manager to close the window because he locked out the menu functions, Then I emailed him for some pics (since he locked it so you cannot copy his pics) and he wants $10 for a set that I could not use in the article. (He said it's for personal use only.) I don't mind people protecting their copyrighted pics or even selling them, But he's going a little far with the "Private use only" <BR>Actually acording to his website, the subs and amps are the only thing mounted in the car. He is still using stock speakers up front until he "Figures out what he wants and where"<P>I actually think that Fierosounds sub install is the best. You lose less room and can still see out the back window. I actually think that it is illegal in some areas to block the rear window permenatly like he did.<P>||||reg||1
